+	 * clamped at the upper level: the sensor transmits, the PHY hears the
+	 * lanes, and not a single start sync reaches the CSID.
+	 *
+	 * It is exactly the failure seen here, and it is described the same way by whoever
+	 * found it on an SM7125 (Atoll, CSIPHY v1.2.2), which is the sibling of
+	 * this SoC:
