+	 *   "sensor s_stream(1) + CCI writes + regulators complete, but
+	 *    the CSID0 IRQ counter stays at zero during a STREAMON of
+	 *    several seconds and the capture file is 0 bytes"
+	 *
+	 * On v1.2.1 (lane_regs_sm8250) these terminators are repeated
